This product implements the OASIS MQTT Version 5.0 protocol specification:
https://docs.oasis-open.org/mqtt/mqtt/v5.0/mqtt-v5.0.html

Normative protocol names, field identifiers, reason codes, packet layouts, and
behavioral requirements are derived from that public standard. MQTT is a
trademark of the OASIS Open standards consortium; this project is not endorsed
or certified by OASIS.

The Native transport uses moonbitlang/async, licensed under Apache-2.0:
https://github.com/moonbitlang/async

MoonMQTT is an original MoonBit implementation. No source code from another
MQTT client implementation is included.
